    "text": "mykxlg.com\nwebsite\nAberdeen\nAvera Foundation Reports Record-Setting Giving in 2025\nBy Holly McKernan,\n1 days agoThe Avera Foundation set a new annual fundraising record in fiscal year 2025, raising more than $59.7 million — the highest total in its history. This achievement was made possible by 21,038 supporters, the most ever recorded in a single year. Among them were 4,296 new donors who made their first gift to Avera, and 3,691 loyal donors who have given for five consecutive years.",
